--TEST--
a `#[Test]` method has no "used by" lens, it and its class have a reference count only where something refers to them, and a helper of the test class keeps its lenses, `rule:ide/used-by-counts-the-routes-and-tests-that-reach-a-method`
--FILE--
<?nvs
use Core\Test;

class Prices {
    public function base(): int {
        return 3;
    }
}

class PricesTest {
    #[Test]
    public function baseIsThree(): void {
        Test::assertEquals(3, $this->price());
    }
    #[Test]
    public function baseTwice(): void {
        $this->baseIsThree();
        $this->baseIsThree();
    }
    private function price(): int {
        return new Prices()->base();
    }
}
--REQUEST--
codeLens
--EXPECT--
4:7 1 reference -> case.nvs:21:20
5:21 1 reference -> case.nvs:21:30
5:21 used by 0 routes, 2 tests (static) -> runs PricesTest::baseIsThree, PricesTest::baseTwice
12:21 2 references -> case.nvs:17:16, case.nvs:18:16
20:22 1 reference -> case.nvs:13:38
20:22 used by 0 routes, 2 tests (static) -> runs PricesTest::baseIsThree, PricesTest::baseTwice
